        `reg 35 the fact holds of the income` `er3 income: a workers' compensation payment received or to be received` facts
    AND NOT (`reg 35 the fact holds of the income` `er3 income: a lump sum or pension paid in full and final settlement of a claim made for workers' compensation payments` facts)

