    OR `reg 35 the fact holds of the income` `er3 income: a payment under a leave plan for the care of a child or children referred to in subsection 23(1) or 152.05(1) of the Act` facts
    OR `reg 35 the fact holds of the income` `er3 income: a payment under a leave plan for the care or support of a family member referred to in subsection 23.1(2) or 152.06(1) of the Act` facts
    OR `reg 35 the fact holds of the income` `er3 income: a payment under a leave plan for the care or support of a critically ill child` facts
